# Support Tickets Analytics Dashboard

![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/status-case%20study-brightgreen)
![Tech](https://img.shields.io/badge/stack-HTML%20%7C%20CSS%20%7C%20JavaScript-blue)
![UI](https://img.shields.io/badge/focus-UI%20%26%20UX-yellow)

A small front‑end case study for a **support tickets analytics dashboard** built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. It focuses on clear KPIs, interactive filters, and a simple chart showing how tickets are distributed by status.[web:694][web:704]

---

## Demo

> 🔗 Live demo (GitHub Pages):  
> `https://USERNAME.github.io/support-tickets-analytics-ui/`

Update `USERNAME` with your GitHub username and enable GitHub Pages for the `main` branch to make the demo live.[web:703][web:712]

